<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="uz">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Milliy Sertifikat & SAT Matematika AI</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
</head>
<body class="bg-slate-900 text-white min-h-screen flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-4">
    <div class="max-w-2xl w-full bg-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-2xl border border-slate-700">
        <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-emerald-400 mb-2 text-center">Matematika AI O'qituvchisi</h1>
        <p class="text-slate-400 text-center mb-6">Milliy Sertifikat va SAT testlariga interaktiv tayyorgarlik</p>
        
        <div class="bg-slate-900 rounded-xl p-4 mb-4 h-64 overflow-y-auto border border-slate-700">
            <div class="bg-emerald-900/40 border border-emerald-500/30 p-3 rounded-lg text-emerald-200 text-sm mb-2">
                <strong>AI Ustoz:</strong> Assalomu alaykum! Matematika bo'yicha qanday misol yoki mavzuda yordam kerak?
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex gap-2">
            <input type="text" placeholder="Masalani yozing yoki formulani kiriting..." class="flex-1 bg-slate-900 border border-slate-700 rounded-xl px-4 py-3 text-white focus:outline-none focus:border-emerald-500">
            <button class="bg-emerald-500 hover:bg-emerald-600 text-slate-900 font-bold px-6 py-3 rounded-xl transition">Yuborish</button>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
